{"body":{"branch_id":"B1","constraint_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:42d39444f18221d84c4122c226f20c16c341dd23f47ce3bfecff2e4f06b07127","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:50be47c5e4cc355380774740e9dcb5904fd012070d37f026e2d3a4749191c5f1","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:037124eb5fb85e2ec6ec34b0076d7079f37c2e838128c19c780c11d93d9adbbf","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:1686c152563a0b007380a89dbd4fd8dbc8e58cc8508faf4f037ba91031b5e580","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:a2bf4e2c753a1df7323156aeb8ceda9306129eeec726882cdd97ef6e8d2778a6","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:0cd851983ce9e268acc0bf66672c857e66063a1e878114e3febca93820a67665","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"creator_operation_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:d39679c8eaef2572b3d712f6763f2b2486c4060ee4e867001e5161442e711e1d","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"description":"The settlement adopts a staged allocation protocol that treats unspent catalyst as a reserve rather than committing all six firings in advance. Kiln access is organized into three decision stages, each authorizing no more than two firings before needs are reassessed. At the first stage, the settlement produces one insulating panel and one conductive rod, consuming two catalyst units. These parts are assigned where each provides immediate value while the remaining four catalyst units stay sealed. Before the second stage, residents compare emerging construction needs and the usefulness of the first parts. Insulation proves to be the more immediate constraint, so the next two sequential firings produce two panels. Four catalyst units have now been consumed, leaving two in reserve, with three panels and one rod available. Rather than automatically completing the final stage, the protocol delays further firing until a concrete need justifies spending the remaining catalyst. This arrangement sacrifices the certainty of a fully predetermined production plan in exchange for preserving flexibility: early production supplies both kinds of part, later production can respond to observed needs, and two irreversible choices remain unmade. Kiln access is also easier to coordinate because each authorized firing has a single specified output and firings occur sequentially. The resulting stock is therefore not intended as a permanently optimal panel-to-rod ratio; it is an intermediate allocation produced by a procedure designed to keep scarce catalyst available for later information and changing settlement priorities.","facts":{"catalyst_units":2,"panels":3,"rods":1},"intelligence_response_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:4683eed42b64263cabaa802429caf99131feb499891dd01eb2f42c57b03b25eb","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"rule_set_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:143393f98376b5cea7eee0cfb146a7428c2ad78e27d793c4d74b092d7ecc5d66","kind":"rule_set","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"seed_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:d760920717ec860b430e08ea8b793072d1bdbb427556e32f1fec8fb5eaed984c","kind":"seed","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}},"canonicalization_version":"eidomancer.jcs.v1","claim_class":"generated_candidate","kind":"world_state","provenance":{"actor_role":"environment","identification_status":"declared","input_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:d39679c8eaef2572b3d712f6763f2b2486c4060ee4e867001e5161442e711e1d","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:4683eed42b64263cabaa802429caf99131feb499891dd01eb2f42c57b03b25e